--- !u!114 &8842775464285001322
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7296949438446446001}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0873e866259d09142ad18077ca66b304, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueManager: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueLines:
  - "OldMan: Ah, you\u2019ve arrived. I\u2019ve been waiting."
  - 'Traveller: Who are you?'
  - 'OldMan: It doesn''t matter. what matters right now is that you are here. So
    what are you looking for?'
  - 'Traveller: I am looking for THE ANSWER to my question.'
  - 'OldMan: And what is your mind wondering?'
  - 'Traveller: The question I have is what is the purpose of my life? '
  - 'OldMan: To find THE ANSWER to your question you will have to go through the
    forest and fight your anscestors so they guide you to THE ANSWER.'
  - 'Traveller: But I dont know how to fight, so how can I defeat them?'
  - 'OldMan: Don''t worry young man you come from a warriors bloodline, you are a
    natural, and I will teach you...'
  - 'OldMan: lets start with the easiest move. Try clickin LEFT-CLICK to performe
    a light attack.'
  - 'Traveller: okay but a basic attack wont be enough to defeat trained warriors..'
  - 'OldMan: Patience young man, next try using your RIGHT-CLICK, to performe a heavy
    attack.'
  - 'Traveller: Woahhh that was so cool and looks powerful!!! But how can I avoid
    their attacks?'
  - 'OldMan: To dodge the enemy attack press LEFT-SHIFT key.'
  - 'Traveller: I feel like I am ready where do I head to?'
  - 'OldMan: young men these days really lack patience, go through the portal between
    the two trees behind me and it will lead you to the first ancestor that you have
    to face.... GOODLUCK YOUNG MAN...'
